# ── API Gateway ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server-side only (NOT NEXT_PUBLIC_). Used by Next.js API routes to reach
# the API gateway. Never exposed to the browser.
#
# Local dev (standalone Next.js): leave unset → defaults to http://localhost:8080
# K8s cluster:                    set via deployment env var (see infra/k8s/)
#
# API_GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:8080
